'''Chroma Beachy''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by purchasing the Beachy Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or the [[Beach Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
It uses the same mesh as [[Beachy]] however some parts have been altered to alternating colors.

== Trivia ==

* It pairs with the godly gun [[Chroma Sands]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma Beachy Set|Chroma Beach Set]].
* It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Beachy]].
